                "title": "Sandcast Rectangular Lockset",
                "description": "The Sandcast Rectangular Lockset has a rustic look with its covered deadbolt and bronze finishes. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes for a colonial look that would be at home on any plantation house. The Sandcast Missoula Keyed Style Lockset is available with a wide array of lever and knob choices for a finished look that matches your personality. The Missoula Sideplate is available in dummy, single cylinder, and interconnected single cylinder functions.",
                "keywords": "Sandcast Rectangular Keyed Style Locksets, Sandcast Rectangular Locksets, Emtek 7565, Emtek 7560, EMT-7565, Emtek Rectangular Entry Sets, Rectangular Entry Door Locksets, Sandcast Rectangular Keyed Style Sideplate Locksets, rustic handlesets, Handlesets with covered deadbolts."
